LC 1343: Number of Sub-arrays of Size K and Average ≥ Threshold

ALGO:
Take a window of size k.
Find its sum.
If sum >= k × threshold, count it.
Slide the window.

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    int numOfSubarrays(vector<int>& a, int k, int threshold) {
        int sum = 0, ans = 0;

        for (int i = 0; i < a.size(); i++) {
            sum += a[i];

            if (i >= k)
                sum -= a[i-k];

            if (i >= k-1 && sum >= k * threshold)
                ans++;
        }

        return ans;
    }
};

EX:
arr = [2,2,2,2,5,5,5,8], k = 3, threshold = 4

Required sum = 3 × 4 = 12

